<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="CGF1_MWP_SemiBattleRifle_T1">
		<defName>CGF1_MWP_VC_SVT40_Conversion_</defName>
		<label>VC SVT-40 Conversion</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x54mmR. 30-round detachable mag. Semi-Automatic.
		
This is a Soviet SVT-40 rifle that was heavily altered in a Vietnamese workshop at some point during the Indochina conflict or Vietnam War. The rifle's wooden stock has been completely replaced in favor of a fixed metal wire-stock and a pistol grip. The internal magazine has been replaced by a Bren gun's magazine modified to fit 7.62x54mmR cartridges, significantly increasing the capacity. Despite the extensive modifications to make the rifle combat capable, it is unknown if this was ever used in combat.</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>CGF1/Gun/VC_SVT40_Conversion</texPath>
			<drawSize>1.00</drawSize>
		</graphicData>
